OL,4,ASwinney faces questions from opposition
OL,5,Aparty leaders
OL,6,
OL,7,FScotland's Chief Medical Officer Gregor
OL,8,FSmith resigns from his post on health
OL,9,Fgrounds. It comes in the wake of
OL,10,Fserious problems with healthcare in the
OL,11,Fnorth east of Scotland
OL,13,FIt comes ahead of First Minister John
OL,14,FSwinney where he is expected to face
OL,15,Fquestions about the state of NHS
OL,16,FGrampian during his weekly Q&A with
OL,17,Fopposition party leaders
